msgid "Toggles output of a frequency band on and off"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:96
msgid "Gain"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:97
msgid "Controls a decks input volume"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:98
msgid "Vol. Deck A/B"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:99
msgid "Controls a decks output volume"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:100
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:145
msgid "Keypad 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:101
msgid "Toggles a channels flanger effect on and off"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:102
#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:151
msgid "Keypad 4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:103
msgid "Reveses playback direction when held down"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:106
msgid "Advanced mapping"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:108
msgid ""
"The advanced mapping works similar to the normal RMX mapping, but also "
"supports loops and hot cues. This mapping was added to not brake the "
"previous (Mixxx -1.7.2) behaviour. Controls that differ between the normal "
"and advanced mappings are described here."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:123
msgid ""
"Toggles scratch on and off which changes the function of the deck jog "
"wheels. **Effect Shift** when held down: Shifts function of each decks Bass,"
" Medium, Treble to control effect parameters. Shifts the Keypad (1-6) "
"functions to effects. Currently flanger and reverse"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:136
msgid ""
"**Deck shift** changes behaviour of other controls related to this deck when"
" held down"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:138
msgid ""
"Adjusts position of loop in/out and hot cues when a loop / hot cue button is"
" held down"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:140
msgid ""
"Adjusts the volume of a channels low frequency content (ex. bass drum). Soft"
" takeover when Deck Shift is held down, lets you move knob in position "
"before adjusting. Adjusts flanger period when Scratch is held down"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:142
msgid ""
"Adjusts the volume of a channels mid frequency content (ex. vocals). Soft "
"takeover when Deck Shift is held down, lets you move knob in position before"
" adjusting. Adjusts flanger delay when Scratch is held down"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:144
msgid ""
"Adjusts the volume of a channels high frequency content (ex. hi-hats). Soft "
"takeover when Deck Shift is held down, lets you move knob in position before"
" adjusting. Adjusts flanger depth when Scratch is held down"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:146
msgid ""
"Go to hotcue 1. Set hotcue 1 when Deck Shift is held down. Toggles a "
"channels flanger effect on and off when Effect Shift is held down"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:147
msgid "Keypad 2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:148
msgid "Go to hotcue 2. Set hotcue 2 when Deck Shift is held down"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:149
msgid "Keypad 3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:150
msgid "Go to hotcue 3. Set hotcue 3 when Deck Shift is held down"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:152
msgid ""
"Hold down to adjust loop in position with Forward / Backward. Set loop in "
"when Deck Shift is held down. Reveses playback direction when held down if "
"Effect Shift is held down"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:153
msgid "Keypad 5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:154
msgid ""
"Hold down to adjust loop out position with Forward / Backward. Set loop out "
"when Deck Shift is held down"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:155
msgid "Keypad 6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx.md:156
msgid ""
"Re-loop / exit turns looping on and off. Half loop when Deck Shift is held "
"down"
msgstr ""
